## Hints for Future Agents
The post-commit hook can fetch, rebase, and push automatically when origin/master has advanced. Inspect autostash results immediately because unrelated working changes can conflict. README.md also contains an unstaged LiteLLM section; only the Codespaces section belongs to this commit. CLAUDE.md, local-bin/litellm-proxy.sh, and configs/litellm remain unrelated user work. Apple container now has the default kernel plus Go 1.24 and Go 1.25 Dev Containers images cached.

## Codebase Discoveries
The go-install Make macro previously continued to a success message after go install failed. Official Dev Containers images can set GOPATH=/go rather than $HOME/go. The Linux bashrc assumed Homebrew existed at an absolute path. GitHub Codespaces recognizes a root install.sh for personal dotfiles setup.

